  "notes": "{斡旋|あっせん} involves acting as an intermediary between parties.\n\nFORMS:\n{斡旋|あっせん}する: to mediate, to arrange, to introduce\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {斡旋|あっせん}を{受|う}ける: to receive a referral/introduction\n- {斡旋|あっせん}を{依頼|いらい}する: to request mediation\n- {労働|ろうどう}{斡旋|あっせん}: employment placement\n- {不動産|ふどうさん}{斡旋|あっせん}: real estate brokerage\n\nWRITING:\n{斡|あつ} and {旋|せん} are relatively rare kanji. The word is sometimes written in hiragana as あっせん.",
